{"version":1,"title":"[BUAA ML]Post-Training - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\" style=\"--bg-url:url('https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUFaR.png')\"><img class=\"lazy bg\" data-src=\"https://s41.ax1x.com/2026/08/31/pniUFaR.png\">\n  <div class=\"content\" data-text-adaptive=\"split\">\n    <div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-top\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"banner-mask banner-mask-bottom\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"menu\" href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" id=\"proj\" href=\"/posts/8db1062d/\">26 ML</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">1721 字 · 约 6 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2026-07-12T08:55:33.000Z\">2026-07-12</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-07-27T16:00:28.188Z\">2026-07-28</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[BUAA ML]Post-Training</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><h2 id=\"Pre-Training\">Pre-Training</h2>\n<p><ruby>预训练<rt>Pre-Training</rt></ruby>指的是在大量数据的基础上训练一个具有通用能力的模型。比如使用 Transformer 架构，通过大量的输入和输出数据训练出基础模型。</p>\n<p>典型的预训练方法是<ruby>自回归预训练<rt>Autoregressive Pre-training</rt></ruby>。对于一个输入「今天天气很好。」，假设通过 Tokenizer 后得到「今天」「天气」「很」「好」四个 Token，模型首先会根据输入「今天」去预测下一个 Token 「天气」，然后根据「今天」「天气」去预测「很」，以此类推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Post-Training\">Post-Training</h2>\n<p><ruby>后训练<rt>Post-Training</rt></ruby>指的是在预训练完成的基础模型上继续训练，使一个具有基本能力的基础模型学习各方向的专业能力。</p>\n<p>举例来说，向模型发出请求「帮我写一封邮件，要求是……」，模型或许可以写出全文，但对邮件的格式、用语等没有概念。后训练可以使模型获得这种能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"SFT\">SFT</h3>\n<p><ruby>有监督微调<rt>Supervised Fine-Tuning</rt></ruby>通过人工标注的数据进一步训练基础模型，让模型可以更加精准地处理特定领域的任务。</p>\n<p>以下是一个人工标注的<strong>对话系统</strong>数据样例：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight json\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"punctuation\">[</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// OMITTED ...</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"punctuation\">{</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"instruction\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"分类以下数字系列。\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"输入：\\n2、4、6、8\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"output\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"此系列数字为偶数序列。\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"punctuation\">{</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"instruction\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"列出一个应该在野营应急包中的7件物品。\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attr\">\"output\"</span><span class=\"punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"string\">\"这是一个我们应该在野营应急包中放置的7件物品列表：\\n\\n1. 先进救援包：用于治疗划痕，创伤，烧伤，刀伤等紧急情况。\\n2. 多用途刀具：可用于切割，锯木，开瓶，刮刀等。\\n3. 手电筒和备用电池：用于夜间照明。\\n4. 火种：火柴或打火机，用于生火取暖或烹饪。\\n5. 压缩饼干和能量棒：紧急能量补给。\\n6. 可充电无线收音机：用于接收天气预报或求救信号。\\n7. 防水雨衣和毛毯：用于防止降雨和保暖。\"</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"punctuation\">,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"comment\">// OMITTED ...</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"punctuation\">]</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<p><strong>微调通常指的是有监督微调</strong>。</p>\n<p>微调主要可以分为<ruby>全参数微调<rt>Full Fine-Tuning</rt></ruby>和<ruby>部分参数微调<rt>Partial Fine-Tuning</rt></ruby>。</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-0\">\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>FFT：</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">对整个预训练模型进行微调，会更新所有参数</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">优点：通常能得到最佳的性能，因为可以更新所有参数</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">需要较大的计算资源，容易出现过拟合</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-2\">\n<p>PFT：</p>\n<ul class=\"lvl-2\">\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">只更新模型的部分参数</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">优点：减少计算成本和过拟合风险，以较小的代价得到不错的结果</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-4\">缺点：可能无法达到最佳性能</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目前应用最广泛的是 LoRA 微调算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"LoRA\">LoRA</h4>\n<p><ruby>低秩自适应<rt>Low-Rank Adaption</rt></ruby>的核心思想是不去调整整个模型的参数（全部参数可以视作一个满秩矩阵 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span></span></span></span>），而是增加一个变化量，并假定这个变化量本身具有低秩结构。记参数矩阵为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，参数变化量为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span></span></span></span>，输入为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span>，输出为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span>，那么核心思想可以表达为：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\nh = W_0x + \\Delta Wx = W_0x + BAx\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> 是两个低秩矩阵。</p>\n<p>典型的应用 LoRA 的例子是更新 Transformer 架构的 Attention 层参数<sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn1\" id=\"fnref1\">[1]</a></sup>。</p>\n<p>在 LoRA 算法中，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「被冻结」的，保持不变。然后用一个随机的高斯分布初始化 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span>，令 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 等于零矩阵，这样初始化情况下 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BA=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，保证模型不发生任何改变。</p>\n<p>然后通过反向传播来更新 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 两个矩阵。</p>\n<p>LoRA 不会训练 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span></span></span></span>，因为假设 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d\\times r},A\\in\\mathbb{R}^{r\\times k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ll \\min(d, k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，进而 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 参数量之和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(d+k) \\ll dk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span></span><sup class=\"footnote-ref\"><a href=\"#fn2\" id=\"fnref2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"RLHF\">RLHF</h3>\n<p><ruby>从人类反馈中强化学习<rt>Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback</rt></ruby>通过「奖励」来使模型学习决策策略。RLHF 主要有以下方式：</p>\n<h4 id=\"PPO\">PPO</h4>\n<p><ruby>近端策略优化<rt>Proximal Policy Optimization</rt></ruby>通过奖励信号的方式渐进式调整模型的行为，调整幅度较小。譬如用户对模型的答案点赞/点踩。</p>\n<p>通常来说，PPO 需要经过以下步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>SFT</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p><strong>训练奖励模型</strong>：收集人类对多个回答的偏好排序数据，并训练一个模型来模拟人类的打分</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"lvl-3\">\n<p>应用 PPO 策略：把奖励模型的打分作为奖励信号，使模型生成更高奖励（即更符合人类偏好）的回答</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"DPO\">DPO</h4>\n<p><ruby>直接偏好优化<rt>Direct Preference Optimization</rt></ruby>通过对比人类的选择来优化模型，调整幅度比较大。譬如模型一次生成两个答案，请用户选择更好的一个。</p>\n<p>事实上 DPO 已经省去了强化学习的环节。不需要显示地训练奖励模型。</p>\n<h4 id=\"GRPO\">GRPO</h4>\n<p><ruby>组内相对策略优化<rt>Group Relative Policy Optimization</rt></ruby>是 PPO 的改进版，是一种强化学习算法。它不需要单独训练奖励模型，而是通过比较同一个问题生成的<strong>多个答案</strong>，在组内计算相对优势来更新模型。</p>\n<p>GRPO 的核心思想是对同一个问题让模型生成多个答案，并通过奖励函数计算各个答案的评分。模型通过各答案的评分来学习到答案的好坏。因模型并没有直接学习答案绝对意义上的好坏，而是「相对本组其它答案」的好坏，因而得名 “Group Relative”。</p>\n<h3 id=\"RAG\">RAG</h3>\n<p><ruby>检索增强生成<rt>Retrieval-Augmented Generation</rt></ruby>将检索到的外部信息与文本生成相结合，帮助模型在生成答案时，可以实时获取外部信息。<strong>避免每次外部信息更新都要微调模型的麻烦</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"LLaMA-Factory\">LLaMA Factory</h2>\n<p>LLaMa Factory 是一个微调框架。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增加训练集\">增加训练集</h3>\n<p>参照 <code>./LlamaFactory/data/README.md</code> 中的格式要求准备 JSON 格式的数据集，然后在 <code>dataset_info.json</code> 注册。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Batch-Size\">Batch Size</h3>\n<p>批处理大小越大，所需计算资源越多，训练效果越好。批处理大小过小容易陷入局部最优解。</p>\n<h3 id=\"导出模型\">导出模型</h3>\n<p>微调事实上训练的是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span> 两个低秩矩阵，我们可以将矩阵运算结果加回到原来的参数矩阵，得到一个微调好的模型。</p>\n<hr class=\"footnotes-sep\">\n<section class=\"footnotes\">\n<ol class=\"footnotes-list\">\n<li id=\"fn1\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.09685\"><em>LORA: LOW-RANK ADAPTATION OF LARGE LAN<br>\nGUAGE MODELS</em> 4.2 APPLYING LORA TO TRANSFORMER</a> <a href=\"#fnref1\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n<li id=\"fn2\" class=\"footnote-item\"><p><a href=\"\"><em>LORA: LOW-RANK ADAPTATION OF LARGE LAN<br>\nGUAGE MODELS</em> 4.1 LOW-RANK-PARAMETRIZED UPDATE MATRICES</a> <a href=\"#fnref2\" class=\"footnote-backref\">↩︎</a></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n</article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}